---
config:
  theme: dark
title: GameSaver — Save Flow
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as Game Code
    participant GS as GameSaver
    participant Sav as Registered ISavables
    participant Ser as ISerializer
    participant Enc as IEncryptionProvider
    participant Store as IStorageProvider

    Caller->>GS: SaveAsync(profileId, metadata)
    Note right of Caller: metadata may be null<br/>(lib uses DefaultSaveMeta)

    rect rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.12)
        Note over GS, Sav: 1. Collect
        loop For each ISavable
            GS->>Sav: CaptureData()
            Sav-->>GS: ISaveData
        end
    end

    rect rgba(255, 165, 0, 0.12)
        Note over GS, Enc: 2. Encode
        GS->>Ser: Serialize(SaveData)
        Ser-->>GS: JSON
        opt UseEncryption
            GS->>Enc: Encrypt(JSON)
            Enc-->>GS: cipher
        end
    end

    rect rgba(0, 200, 100, 0.12)
        Note over GS, Store: 3. Persist
        GS->>Store: WriteAsync(profileId, .sav)
        Store-->>GS: ok
        GS->>Store: WriteAsync(profileId, .meta)
        Store-->>GS: ok
        Note right of Store: .sav = source of truth (encrypted)<br/>.meta = sidecar cache (plain JSON)<br/>Order matters for stale detection
    end

    GS-->>Caller: Handle complete
    GS-->>Caller: Fire OnSaveCompleted(profileId)
